# Build context kept minimal; only explicit files copied by the Dockerfile are
# allowed through.
# This also prevents accidental .env, state/, workspace/, caches, or nested
# repositories from being sent to Docker during builds.
#
# If you start copying files into the image, add explicit `!path/to/file`
# entries below instead of removing this blanket ignore.
*
!browser-fetch/
!browser-fetch/browser-fetch.mjs
